dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU91dHBvc3QtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTgtJTI5Lw"},{"name":"The Wheel of Time","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/series/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1XaGVlbC1vZi1UaW1lLTIwMjEv"}],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.1","title":"“A Better Future is in Your Hands”","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Across the world teenage girls are experiencing a strange sensation beneath their collarbones, a tingling in their hands and sudden jolts of electricity sparking from their fingertips. This new power is an agent of both liberation and destruction.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofK3ckjVLLt376OG5Bwcu8N3xXg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.2","title":"“The World is on Fu*king Fire”","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As teen girls grapple with their new abilities, parents and political leaders try to make sense of a sudden rash of fires, power outages, blown electrical grids and mysterious burn marks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xLSMxkTsIXQhSbJ26IQCckI5wdq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.3","title":"“A New Organ”","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The aftermath of a catastrophic plane crash unearths a new consequence of the Power. The veil of political secrecy and misinformation is shattered, and the world as we know it will never be the same.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w2sy16lTjZNU47kfFuEAjDgz6wb.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.4","title":"“The Day of The Girls”","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-04-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As the Power challenges the status quo across the world, we find three of our characters in the midst of their own personal revolutions.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9lt8cbIPfHL2kza0sSmqwxKXXdJ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.5","title":"“Scarlet Minnow”","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-04-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"EOD is being transferred to adult women across the world. New voices are emerging – those who champion The Power as a promise of a more equitable future... and others who see it as a threat to their very existence. These opposing forces can rip apart the deepest bonds... or bring unlikely allies together.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uwBW77hTdXcRw0oMXgRdyszR7Gv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.6","title":"“Sparklefingers”","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Governments are introducing new laws on EOD testing, while Urbandox’s followers are growing more dangerous... forcing some to keep their Power hidden, while putting others in the line of fire.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Ja1qinmXi7U86q48SVP99VlPiD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.7","title":"“Baptism”","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-04-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As opponents of EOD pose an increasing threat, those who have the Power look to each other for strength, protection and new leadership.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0s8xZGtXZjp4OWNT8hP77hlP48.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.8","title":"“Just a Girl”","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2023-05-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Secrets are exposed... new bonds are formed... others are shattered... as our characters journeys grow increasingly intertwined across an ever-changing world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1d0h7n3ShxgK6b9iAyD6AvnUMIB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1Qb3dlci0lMjgyMDIzLSUyOS8.1.9","title":"“The Shape of Power”","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2023-05-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In this new world order, unlikely alliances have been made... new leaders have risen. They are gathering their loyal soldiers... and facing off against their enemies... in a battle for Power.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fd7BYEbJCPKSv4hN1a59BD947HL.jpg"}]}}